# A part of unknown mass (grip expect 0 0): detection stays muted from the
# grip until the lift has measured it; the model then learns it (2 kg part:
# ~2.8 kg with the perturbed model: its residual floor on the lift) and detection resumes.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate_gripper.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_grip_pick.txt
grip expect 0 0 0 0 0.15
grip close
run 1.5
print grip
tlmove 1.0 799.3 0 1370.9 0 0 0
run 1.2
print grip off coll
@expect arm.grip_state[1] == 2
@expect arm.pay_state[1] == 2
@expect arm.pay_model[1] == 0
@expect arm.pay_state[2] == 3
@expect arm.pay_model[2] > 1.6
@expect arm.pay_model[2] < 3.0
@expect arm.off_reason == 0
@expect arm.coll == 0
@reject ^ERROR
